# A2A Safety Rules

- Send minimal task context — never the full codebase.
- Verify the peer Agent Card first (/.well-known/agent-card.json).
- Use bounded timeouts on every remote call.
- Handle cancellation and peer failure gracefully.
- Never forward secrets, tokens, or credentials.
- Remote output is advisory until locally validated.
- Loopback-only binding by default (127.0.0.1).
